2. ALL OF PHYSICS AS RAPIDITY OFFSETS FROM PLANCK SCALE
==============================================================================

Every physical quantity is a dimensionless ratio to its Planck counterpart.
In rapidity, these ratios become additive offsets: phi(quantity/Planck_unit).

  Quantity                                          Value    Ratio to Planck   phi(ratio)
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Electron mass / m_P                          9.1094e-31         4.1855e-23     -25.7639
  Proton mass / m_P                            1.6726e-27         7.6850e-20     -22.0062
  Neutron mass / m_P                           1.6749e-27         7.6956e-20     -22.0055
  Bohr radius / l_P                            5.2918e-11         3.2741e+24      28.2240
  Classical electron radius / l_P              2.8180e-15         1.7435e+20      23.3038
