  Compton wavelength (proton) / l_P            1.3210e-15         8.1732e+19      22.9250
  Hydrogen atom radius / l_P                   5.2900e-11         3.2730e+24      28.2239
  1 second / t_P                               1.0000e+00         1.8549e+43      49.8145
  1 year / t_P                                 3.1560e+07         5.8539e+50      58.4482
