==============================================================================

  Particle lifetimes span from ~10^-25 s (top quark) to ~10^3 s (neutron).
  That's 28 orders of magnitude. In rapidity, it's a span of ~32.

  Particle                    Lifetime (s)        tau/t_P   phi(tau/t_P)      Force
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Proton (lower bound)          3.1560e+48     5.8539e+91       105.6512    stable?
  Neutron (free)                8.7940e+02     1.6312e+46        53.2041       weak
  Muon                          2.1970e-06     4.0751e+37        43.3003       weak
  Charged pion                  2.6030e-08     4.8282e+35        41.0825       weak
  Charged kaon                  1.2380e-08     2.2963e+35        40.7109       weak
